WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.970
Rub a polythene rod with a
woollen cloth for a few seconds.

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.990
Now the rod is negatively charged,

3
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.790
and the cloth is positively charged.

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.250
You didn't add anything
to either of them.

5
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.490
Nothing was poured in or plugged in.

6
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.850
So where did the charge come from?

7
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.390
In this mission, you'll find out
which tiny particles can move

8
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.550
when two insulators rub together,

9
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.320
and why gaining them or losing
them makes an object charged.

10
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:29.250
You'll also see how charged objects
push and pull on each other.

11
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.290
Your mission: find out
where the charge came from.
